      "id": "vKEsyHFk/SJ2JMVyz#KVnICaNb",
      "title": "Two callers, two ways in",
      "narrative": "A pane's typed message goes straight to the workhorse of its checkout as turn/start or turn/steer with the board's context, and its queue edits go straight to that thread's queue. Everything the coordinator asks goes through the four operations of the checkout it names instead, one after another, so two of its effects never interleave and each is settled and reported in one place.",
